{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Milowit, knight commander and favored of the king, as he lives out the final days of his sovereign Kingdom of Avitium. After all is said and done, make the choice to stay or go.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your deck</strong> and use it to defeat your enemies in turn-based card battler combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish and defend your convictions through narrative, <strong>trick-taking gameplay</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with a <strong>hand-textured 3D world</strong>, split across two environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the <strong>main story</strong> or test your deckbuilding and combat skills to see how far you can get in<strong> endless mode</strong>. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721560?t=1756857982","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721560/1cf4fd65b023a9037f1726b0d18a5891441e48c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756857982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721560/7ed6d1614c2e3eb512aceece0346102f7abda5f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756857982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721560/7ed6d1614c2e3eb512aceece0346102f7abda5f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756857982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Milowit, knight commander and favored of the king, as he lives out the final days of his sovereign Kingdom of Avitium. After all is said and done, make the choice to stay or go.</p><ul class=\"bb